luam-monolithic-event-large-fragment-sender = TSF Anomaly Observatory
luam-monolithic-event-large-fragment-start-announcement = ATTENTION ALL VESSELS IN THE SECTOR! Long-range sensors detect a space-time rift of unprecedented power. A huge monolithic fragment is emerging from subspace: residual signatures identify it as a former NFSD outpost, completely consumed by the Monolith. Hostile forces and active monolithic defenses are detected aboard. The fragment is marked on radars with a purple signature. Approach only in well-armed groups.
luam-monolithic-event-large-fragment-warning-announcement = WARNING: the rift around the huge monolithic fragment is destabilizing. In five minutes the fragment will be pulled back into subspace. Everyone aboard must evacuate immediately, anyone left behind will be thrown into open space.
luam-monolithic-event-large-fragment-end-announcement = The huge monolithic fragment has disappeared from sensors, the rift has collapsed. The Observatory keeps watching the sector.

luam-monolithic-event-name-large-fragment = #$!@$[Consumed NFSD Outpost]%$^$#
